  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お、愛依、お疲れ様\r\n休憩中か？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1019004020020,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "お疲れ様～\r\nそだよ～",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/101900402/1019004020020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか、じゃあ『もう大丈夫』ってタイミングで\r\n声かけてくれ、見てもらいたいものがあるんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1019004020030,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "今でいいよ～",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101900402/1019004020030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、すまん\r\nじゃあちょっとこのＤＶＤを──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1019004020040,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "へいへーい",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101900402/1019004020040"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0350",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 3500
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "よし、再生",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0351",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1200
  },
  {
    "speaker": "テレビの音声",
    "text": "『ピックアップアイドル～』",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "これ、音楽番組のミニコーナーなんだけど\r\n知ってるか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1019004020050,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "もちろん♪\r\n気になる人が出る時とか見てるし！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/101900402/1019004020050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おお、それなら話が早い\r\n今愛依にオファーが来ててな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1019004020060,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "マジ！？",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101900402/1019004020060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、マジだ\r\nまだ返事はしてないんだけど",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1019004020070,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "出る出る～",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101900402/1019004020070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "って言ってくれる雰囲気を感じてたよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1019004020080,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "さっすがプロデューサー",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101900402/1019004020080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、どういたしまして",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ちなみに、番組の事で何か気になることはあるか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1019004020090,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "うーん……\r\nあ！　収録の時、お客さんって入る？",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101900402/1019004020090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、関係者だけだ\r\n観覧はないよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1019004020100,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "よかった～……！",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101900402/1019004020100"
  },
  {
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textFrame": "off"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "愛依はそこが一番気になるよな\r\n……他は何かあるか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1019004020110,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "たぶん大丈夫！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101900402/1019004020110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "よし、じゃあ先方にはオファーを受ける旨\r\n伝えておくよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そのＤＶＤは参考になると思うから\r\n何回か見ておいてくれると助かる",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1019004020120,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "はいはーい",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101900402/1019004020120"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "eye_right",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
